OL,3,GNEWSACrash driver accused of A&E 'ruse'
OL,4,Ato avoid court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who killed her friend when she
OL,7,Fcrashed a rented Lamborghini on the M62
OL,8,Fhas been arrested at hospital after she
OL,9,Ffailed to turn up for sentencing.
OL,11,FHumaira Batool, 26, was due to be
OL,12,Fsentenced at Leeds Crown Court for
OL,13,Fcausing the death of 20-year-old
OL,14,FMohammed Shaan Hussain in 2022 but did
OL,15,Fnot appear.
OL,17,FHer barrister said she had not come to
OL,18,Fcourt as she had gone to A&E due to a
OL,19,Fflare-up of endometriosis, however
OL,20,Fprosecutor Christopher Dunn said it was
OL,21,F"clearly a ruse".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
