OL,3,GNEWSACrash driver accused of A&E 'ruse'
OL,4,Ato avoid court
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Ray Singh issued a bench warrant
OL,7,Ffor Batool, saying she was "avoiding
OL,8,Fbeing dealt with". The defendant was
OL,9,Flater arrested at hospital and taken to
OL,10,Fcourt where she was then remanded in
OL,11,Fcustody to be sentenced on Tuesday.
